fallback_18=The game did not shut down properly the last time it ran. If that was caused by a problem with the game, starting it in recovery mode is recommended.
fallback_19=Safe mode options: if you have problems with the game, use the options below.
fallback_2=Turn off sound
fallback_20=Start the game
fallback_21=If you have problems, starting the game in safe mode is recommended.
fallback_22=The Unreal web site has tips for solving problems with the game.
fallback_23=These settings will be kept for later runs of the game.
fallback_24=These settings will be kept only until you quit this session.
fallback_25=These settings take effect only after the game is restarted.
fallback_26=There is not enough free space on your hard disk to run the game. Quit the game, delete or archive data you do not need, then start the game again.
fallback_27=Hardware problems
fallback_29=An error occurred during the game. Quit the game, open ReadMe.txt (on the game disc) and follow the instructions there.
