helpfulhint_1=You can see your current task in the main menu. Press Esc to open it.
helpfulhint_2=Press Tab to see the Marauder's Map, a plan of the school and its grounds.
helpfulhint_3=To see how well you are doing in the mini-games, go to the main menu (Esc) and click the mini-games icon.
helpfulhint_4=All your collector cards are kept in the album.
helpfulhint_5=To look at your card collection, go to the main menu (Esc) and click the card icon.
helpfulhint_6=To see how many beans, pumpkin pasties and cauldron cakes you have, go to the main menu (Esc) and click the backpack icon.
