menuobjectives_1=Find Scabbers.
menuobjectives_10=Go to Charms class (third floor).
menuobjectives_11=Complete the Glacius challenge. Collect all ten shields to open the bonus room.
menuobjectives_12=Rescue Ron.
menuobjectives_13=Protect Sirius Black from the Dementors.
menuobjectives_14=Save Buckbeak.
menuobjectives_15=Defeat the Dementors with the Patronus Charm.
menuobjectives_16=Go to Professor Lupin's office to take your exam.
menuobjectives_18=Pass the Carpe Retractum exam.
menuobjectives_19=Pass the Draconifors and Lapifors exam.
menuobjectives_2=Complete the Carpe Retractum challenge. Collect all ten shields to open the bonus room.
menuobjectives_20=Pass the Glacius exam.
menuobjectives_21=Complete every task on the list and go back to Professor Dumbledore; he is waiting for you in the school courtyard.
menuobjectives_22=Defeat Peeves.
menuobjectives_23=Defeat the Monster Book of Monsters five times.
menuobjectives_24=Defeat the pixies five times.
menuobjectives_25=Make five hippogriff flights.
menuobjectives_26=Protect Harry from the Dementor.
menuobjectives_27=Find Fred and George's shop.
menuobjectives_3=Follow Fred to his shop on the eighth floor.
menuobjectives_4=Take Neville to the hippogriff paddock.
menuobjectives_5=Learn to fly a hippogriff.
menuobjectives_6=Go to Transfiguration class (second floor).
menuobjectives_7=Complete the Draconifors and Lapifors challenge. Collect all ten shields to open the bonus room.
menuobjectives_8=Learn to defend yourself against the Dementors.
menuobjectives_9=Find the book that tells how to save Buckbeak.
