portrait_passwd_1=The portrait of Hesper Starkey hangs above the desk on the third floor. Its password is "Crescent Moon".
portrait_passwd_10=The portrait of Bridget Wenlock hangs by the entrance to the seventh floor. Its password is "Hobby Horse".
portrait_passwd_11=The portrait of Leopoldina Smethwyck hangs in a small room on the eighth floor. Its password is "Tumbleweed".
portrait_passwd_2=This is the portrait password menu. You can buy passwords at Fred and George's shop.
portrait_passwd_3=You can buy this password at Fred and George's shop.
portrait_passwd_4=The portrait of Glover Hipworth hangs in a small room in the dungeons. Its password is "Bless you!"
portrait_passwd_6=The portrait of Mopsus hangs by the first door in the dungeons. Its password is "Verily!"
portrait_passwd_7=The portrait of Bertie Bott hangs in a small room on the fifth floor. Its password is "Tra-la-la!"
portrait_passwd_8=The portrait of Derwent Shimpling hangs on the sixth floor. Its password is "Rub-a-dub-dub".
portrait_passwd_9=The portrait of Tilly Toke hangs at the end of the corridor on the second floor. Its password is "Dirigible".
