vendor_popup_10=This password opens the secret room behind the portrait of Bridget Wenlock.
vendor_popup_11=This password opens the secret room behind the portrait of Leopoldina Smethwyck.
vendor_popup_12=Chocolate Frog
vendor_popup_13=Chocolate restores your health at once.
vendor_popup_14=Pumpkin Pasty
vendor_popup_15=Want to buy something from Fred and George but short of pasties? Trade your beans for them and off you go shopping!
vendor_popup_16=Cauldron Cake
vendor_popup_17=Some things at Fred and George's shop can only be had for cauldron cakes, and you can get cauldron cakes for your beans.
vendor_popup_18=Portrait Password
vendor_popup_19=The Last Card
vendor_popup_2=Don't Buy
vendor_popup_20=Collect 74 cards and Fred and George will give you the last collector card absolutely free! You'll also get a wonderful prize! So don't dawdle: start your collection now!
vendor_popup_21=You can't get this item right now.
vendor_popup_3=This password opens the secret room behind the portrait of Hesper Starkey.
